number x is 10
string text is "hello"
list of number nums is [1, 2, 3]

// Wrong property access
number bad1 is columns of x  // Error : columns property can only be used with images
number bad2 is rows of text  // Error : rows property can only be used with images
number bad3 is length of x  // Error : Length property can only be used with lists or strings
number bad4 is columns of nums  // Error : columns property can only be used with images